{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32154","headline":"东峯歌 · 温庭筠","name":"东峯歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦砾潺湲玉溪水，晓来微雨藤花紫。\n冉冉山鸡红尾长，一声樵斧惊飞起。\n松刺梳空石差齿，烟香风软人参蘂。\n阳崖一梦伴云根，仙菌灵芝梦魂里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}